For the install you need to install.
- balenaEtcher
- debian ISO

the debian ISO is the OS we are going to be using its based on the linux kernel you can install it from.  
https://www.debian.org/download

After you installed the ISO we need to flash the ISO on the usb. we are going to do this using balenaEtcher. You can download balenaEtcher on.
https://etcher.balena.io/

open balenaEtcher and click flash from file select the debian ISO and let it flash.


